<?xml version="1.0"?>
<ScenContainer xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema">
  <ScenTitle>Sandbox Scenario #1: Surface Encounter, 1991</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY scroll=auto&gt;&lt;P&gt;&lt;SPAN style="WHITE-SPACE: normal; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; WORD-SPACING: 0px; FLOAT: none; COLOR: rgb(68,68,68); FONT: 13px/20px Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; WIDOWS: 1; DISPLAY: inline !important; LETTER-SPACING: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;FONT color=black&gt;This scenario is based on the scenario "Surface Encounter" from the boardgame Harpoon: Captain's Edition.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;SPAN style="WHITE-SPACE: normal; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; WORD-SPACING: 0px; FLOAT: none; COLOR: rgb(68,68,68); FONT: 13px/20px Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; WIDOWS: 1; DISPLAY: inline !important; LETTER-SPACING: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;FONT color=black&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;SPAN style="WHITE-SPACE: normal; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; WORD-SPACING: 0px; FLOAT: none; COLOR: rgb(68,68,68); FONT: 13px/20px Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; WIDOWS: 1; DISPLAY: inline !important; LETTER-SPACING: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;FONT color=black&gt;&amp;nbsp;In this scenario, an&lt;SPAN class=Apple-converted-space&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;A style="WHITE-SPACE: normal; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; WORD-SPACING: 0px; COLOR: rgb(77,70,156); FONT: 13px/20px Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; TEXT-DECORATION: none; WIDOWS: 1; LETTER-SPACING: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Arleigh_Burke-class_destroyer" target=_blank&gt;&lt;FONT color=black&gt;Arleigh Burke-class&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/A&gt;&lt;SPAN style="WHITE-SPACE: normal; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; WORD-SPACING: 0px; FLOAT: none; COLOR: rgb(68,68,68); FONT: 13px/20px Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; WIDOWS: 1; DISPLAY: inline !important; LETTER-SPACING: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;FONT color=black&gt;&lt;SPAN class=Apple-converted-space&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/SPAN&gt;destroyer is escorting a&amp;nbsp;Whidbey Island class LSD in the Norwegian Sea&amp;nbsp;and it happens to detect a Soviet&lt;SPAN class=Apple-converted-space&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;A style="WHITE-SPACE: normal; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; WORD-SPACING: 0px; COLOR: rgb(77,70,156); FONT: 13px/20px Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; TEXT-DECORATION: none; WIDOWS: 1; LETTER-SPACING: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sovremennyy-class_destroyer" target=_blank&gt;&lt;FONT color=black&gt;Sovremenny-class destroyer&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/A&gt;&lt;SPAN style="WHITE-SPACE: normal; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; WORD-SPACING: 0px; FLOAT: none; COLOR: rgb(68,68,68); FONT: 13px/20px Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; WIDOWS: 1; DISPLAY: inline !important; LETTER-SPACING: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;FONT color=black&gt;&lt;SPAN class=Apple-converted-space&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/SPAN&gt;with an&lt;SPAN class=Apple-converted-space&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;A style="WHITE-SPACE: normal; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; WORD-SPACING: 0px; COLOR: rgb(77,70,156); FONT: 13px/20px Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; TEXT-DECORATION: none; WIDOWS: 1; LETTER-SPACING: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ivan_Rogov-class_landing_ship" target=_blank&gt;&lt;FONT color=black&gt;Ivan Rogov-class landing ship&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/A&gt;&lt;SPAN style="WHITE-SPACE: normal; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; WORD-SPACING: 0px; FLOAT: none; COLOR: rgb(68,68,68); FONT: 13px/20px Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; WIDOWS: 1; DISPLAY: inline !important; LETTER-SPACING: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;FONT color=black&gt;. &amp;nbsp;A skirmish ensues with both sides trying to sink the other's escorted ships. &amp;nbsp;The Soviets win a victory if they sink the&amp;nbsp;LSD while&amp;nbsp;the US&amp;nbsp;wins if it can sink the Rogov.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;</ScenDescription>
  <Complexity>1</Complexity>
